WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.100
Eleven doors on the county plan.
Twelve in her inventory.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.220
She came to catalogue a missing
scientist's estate.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.550
The archive was expecting her.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.200
Using This Matter.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.000
Enter the archive.
